  "name": "Nifty Monthly IronFly Dynamic Hedge Inward Rollover",
  "description": "\n<p><strong>Nifty Monthly IronFly with Margin-Optimized Entry & Dynamic Hedge Inward Rollover</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Strategy Notes & Trading Intent:</strong></p>\n<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p>1. <strong>Entry Criteria:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Underlying:</strong> NIFTY 50 Index (Monthly Expiry Spreads).</li>\n  <li><strong>Entry Window:</strong> Between 9:20 AM and 3:00 PM IST.</li>\n  <li><strong>Trigger Condition:</strong> Margin-Optimized Split: S1 Entry buys long protective hedges (CE + PE) at (Get Strike +/- HedgeGap). S1 Repair Once 1 sells short ATM straddle after long hedges are filled to guarantee broker margin benefits. Entry Window: 9:20 AM to 3:15 PM IST.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2. <strong>Exit Criteria & Risk Parameters:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Target & Stop Loss:</strong> Universal Exit on expiry day at 3:15 PM IST.</li>\n  <li><strong>Universal Exit:</strong> Square off all intraday open positions at 3:15 PM IST.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>3. <strong>Additional Mechanics:</strong></p><ul><li>Margin-Optimized Entry: Long hedges bought in S1 Entry (S1 E), Short straddle sold in S1 Repair Once (S1 R1) once hedge fills are confirmed.</li><li>Dynamic Hedge Gap: Parameterized via HedgeGap variable (default 700 pts) using strikeType=\"Fx\" AST formula.</li><li>Call Hedge Inward Roll: S2 Entry rolls Call hedge inward by Roll_Step (100 pts) when Spot crosses original Call hedge strike.</li><li>Put Hedge Inward Roll: S3 Entry rolls Put hedge inward by Roll_Step (100 pts) when Spot crosses original Put hedge strike.</li></ul>\n",
  "tags": [
    {
      "label": "Pairs",
      "value": 44
    }
  ],
